# zip: lazy Seq path used when both inputs are Seq (zip-seq-impl in prelude)
# Regression: zip-seq-impl uses [match xs Seq: ...] — TypeTag "Seq" must match Seq.Cons Variant
# If seq? returns false for Seq.Cons after the migration, zip falls through to the dict path
# and errors on Seq input, so this test verifies the whole seq? -> zip-seq-impl path works
[length [collect [zip [range 1 4] [range 10 13]]]]
=== out
Int(3)
